nt subagents to research the year-end 2026 outlooks:\\n\\n1. **`btc-analyst`**: Investigating institutional targets, ETF flow impacts, and macro models for **Bitcoin (BTC)**.\\n2. **`spacex-analyst`**: Investigating private\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"New York, USA\",\"SWML_DESCRIPTION_FROM_YOUR_INTERNET_ADDRESS\",false,null,\"//www.google.com/maps/vt/data\\u003dnMCg6iXdxG1_9Y-3lxBgMNf7XktAf8ZikRF5SnVH3vemy3DurJSvkwEbDMwev76f3w1JmQD38qqs0eDts6aKehzMBURQmjpRwyWFtTuLcbvivWab9VVGKDLxGwr_YqVuH5Oum-2eR4Tvs5ng-X5L6VowUexzlmWGfN5hX4B4sON4TvQKbh_LZ9RT78BgMQ21\"],null,null,\"US\",null,null,null,null,null,false,null,null,null,null,\"en\",null,null,null,true,[null,[false,false,true],[false,true,false,false,true,false],false,[[[\"Academic - Other\",2.368192E-4],[\"Coding\",0.009047018],[\"Creative - Other\",8.7247853E-4],[\"Creative Writing\",6.868185E-4],[\"Customer Support\",6.5824183E-6],[\"Daily Life Expert - Other\",0.0010235591],[\"Daily Life Personal - Other\",7.467755E-4],[\"Data Analysis\",0.0013973728],[\"Emotional Support\",7.030264E-4],[\"Engagement - Other\",0.005861722],[\"Events\",6.966008E-5],[\"Finance / Accounting\",4.1637023E-4],[\"Fitness\",1.3618494E-5],[\"Games\",0.006385927],[\"General Info Seeking\",0.05116998],[\"Government / Law\",3.404852E-4],[\"HR / Career Management\",2.0075652E-4],[\"Health\",0.009320209],[\"Life Organizer\",0.0014631776],[\"Lifelong Learning\",0.007049285],[\"Marketing \\u0026 Advertising\",9.1725495E-5],[\"Meals / Nutrition\",0.0023987133],[\"Media / Entertainment\",0.0021064037],[\"Multimodal Generation\",0.0054379543],[\"News / Status\",0.0027520785],[\"Personal Finance\",0.0017320762],[\"Professional - Other\",0.0021531435],[\"Sales / Order Fulfillment\",2.0105865E-5],[\"School Work\",0.57313645],[\"Shopping\",0.0019255384],[\"Social / Ro