 \\\"\\\"\\\"Investigate Wall Street consensus targets and expert analyst forecasts for NVIDIA (NVDA) through the end of 2026.\\nFocus on:\\n1. Mean, high, and low 12-month Wall Street price targets (FactSet/Bloomberg consensus).\\n2. Key drivers (Blackwell ramp, data center capex cycles from hyperscalers, margin expectations).\\n3. Bull vs. bear scenarios.\\nReport back to parent with a structured summary.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nbtc_worker \\u003d await rlm.spawn(btc_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"btc-analyst\\\")\\nspacex_worker \\u003d await rlm.spawn(spacex_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"spacex-analyst\\\")\\nnvda_worker \\u003d await rlm.spawn(nvda_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"nvda-analyst\\\")\\n\",\"python\"]],[null,[null,0,\"I have initiated three independent subagents to research the year-end 2026 outlooks:\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"btc-analyst: Investigating institutional targets, ETF flow impacts, and macro models for Bitcoin (BTC).\",[[0,11,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[0,11,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[89,102,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"spacex-analyst: Investigating private\",[[0,14,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[0,14,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,1]"]]
