[["wrb.fr",null,"[null,[\"c_4c4b001d6b91f316\",\"r_51a52d216ae21d95\"],null,null,[[\"rc_b4f999cb01910f01\",[\"```python\\n# Spawning 3 independent subagents via RLM to investigate predictions for BTC, SpaceX, and NVIDIA through the end of 2026.\\n\\nbtc_prompt \\u003d \\\"\\\"\\\"Investigate consensus forecasts, analyst targets, and expert predictions for Bitcoin (BTC) through the end of 2026.\\nFocus on:\\n1. Major institutional targets (e.g., Standard Chartered, Bernstein, VanEck, Ark Invest).\\n2. Key drivers (halving cycle dynamics, ETF institutional inflows, macro rate outlook).\\n3. Bull, base, and bear case target ranges.\\nReport back to parent with a structured summary.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nspacex_prompt \\u003d \\\"\\\"\\\"Investigate valuation benchmarks, secondary market transactions, and insider/analyst predictions for SpaceX through the end of 2026.\\nFocus on:\\n1. Current private valuation estimates and tender offer trajectories (e.g., $200B+ valuations).\\n2. Key operational drivers (Starlink cash generation/subscriber count, Starship orbital cadence, potential Starlink IPO rumors/timing).\\n3. Industry analyst projections for year-end valuation benchmarks.\\nReport back to parent with a structured summary.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nnvda_prompt \\u003d \\\"\\\"\\\"Investigate Wall Street consensus targets and expert analyst forecasts for NVIDIA (NVDA) through the end of 2026.\\nFocus on:\\n1. Mean, high, and low 12-month Wall Street price targets (FactSet/Bloomberg consensus).\\n2. Key drivers (Blackwell ramp, data center capex cycles from hyperscalers, margin expectations).\\n3. Bull vs. bear scenarios.\\nReport back to parent with a structured summary.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nbtc_worker \\u003d await rlm.spawn(btc_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"btc-analyst\\\")\\nspacex_worker \\u003d await rlm.spawn(spacex_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"spacex-analyst\\\")\\nnvda_worker \\u003d await rlm.spawn(nvda_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"nvda-analyst\\\")\\n```\\n\\nI have initiated three independent subagents to research the year-end 2026 outlooks:\\n\\n1. **`btc-analyst`**: Investigating institutional targets, ETF flow impacts, and macro models for **Bitcoin (BTC)**.\\n2. **`spacex-analyst`**: Investigating private secondary market valuations, Starlink cash-flow milestones, Starship progression, and valuation trajectories for **SpaceX**.\\n3. **`nvda-analyst`**: Tracking Wall Street consensus price targets, Blackwell architecture adoption, hyperscaler capex projections, and risk factors for **NVIDIA (NVDA)**.\\n\\nI will consolidate their independent findings and present a comprehensive comparative synthesis once their reports are delivered.\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[2],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"New York, USA\",\"SWML_DESCRIPTION_FROM_YOUR_INTERNET_ADDRESS\",false,null,\"//www.google.com/maps/vt/data\\u003dnMCg6iXdxG1_9Y-3lxBgMNf7XktAf8ZikRF5SnVH3vemy3DurJSvkwEbDMwev76f3w1JmQD38qqs0eDts6aKehzMBURQmjpRwyWFtTuLcbvivWab9VVGKDLxGwr_YqVuH5Oum-2eR4Tvs5ng-X5L6VowUexzlmWGfN5hX4B4sON4TvQKbh_LZ9RT78BgMQ21\"],null,null,\"US\",null,null,null,null,null,true,null,null,null,null,\"en\",null,null,null,true,[null,[false,false,true],[false,true,false,false,true,false],false,[[[\"Academic - Other\",2.368192E-4],[\"Coding\",0.009047018],[\"Creative - Other\",8.7247853E-4],[\"Creative Writing\",6.868185E-4],[\"Customer Support\",6.5824183E-6],[\"Daily Life Expert - Other\",0.0010235591],[\"Daily Life Personal - Other\",7.467755E-4],[\"Data Analysis\",0.0013973728],[\"Emotional Support\",7.030264E-4],[\"Engagement - Other\",0.005861722],[\"Events\",6.966008E-5],[\"Finance / Accounting\",4.1637023E-4],[\"Fitness\",1.3618494E-5],[\"Games\",0.006385927],[\"General Info Seeking\",0.05116998],[\"Government / Law\",3.404852E-4],[\"HR / Career Management\",2.0075652E-4],[\"Health\",0.009320209],[\"Life Organizer\",0.0014631