aceX through the end of 2026.\\nFocus on:\\n1. Current private valuation estimates and tender offer trajectories (e.g., $200B+ valuations).\\n2. Key operational drivers (Starlink cash generation/subscriber count, Starship orbital cadence, potential Starlink IPO rumors/timing).\\n3. Industry analyst projections for year-end valuation benchmarks.\\nReport back to parent with a structured summary.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nnvda_prompt \\u003d \\\"\\\"\\\"Investigate Wall Street consensus targets and expert analyst forecasts for NVIDIA (NVDA) through the end of 2026.\\nFocus on:\\n1. Mean, high, and low 12-month Wall Street price targets (FactSet/Bloomberg consensus).\\n2. Key drivers (Blackwell ramp, data center capex cycles from hyperscalers, margin expectations).\\n3. Bull vs. bear scenarios.\\nReport back to parent with a structured summary.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nbtc_worker \\u003d await rlm.spawn(btc_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"btc-analyst\\\")\\nspacex_worker \\u003d await rlm.spawn(spacex_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"spacex-analyst\\\")\\nnvda_worker \\u003d await rlm.spawn(nvda_prompt, name\\u003d\\\"nvda-analyst\\\")\\n\",\"python\"]],[null,[null,0,\"I have initiated three independent subagents to research the year-end 2026 outlooks:\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"btc-analyst: Investigating institutional targets, ETF flow impacts, and macro models for Bitcoin (BTC).\",[[0,11,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[0,11,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[89,102,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"spacex-analyst: Investigating private secondary market valuations, Starlink cash-flow milestones, Starship progression, and valuation trajectories for SpaceX.\",[[0,14,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[0,14,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[151,157,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"nvda-analyst: Tracking Wall Street consensus price targets, Blackwell architecture adoption, hyperscaler capex projections, and risk factors for NVIDIA (NVDA).\",[